upstream's code, carried here under upstream's own copyright and license, and
nothing in this repository relicenses them.

1. vendor/  (crate: vitrum-dioxus-desktop)

   A fork of the `dioxus-desktop` crate by Jonathan Kelley.
   Upstream: https://crates.io/crates/dioxus-desktop
   Copyright (c) 2021 Jonathan Kelley
   MIT license, full text at: vendor/LICENSE
   Divergence from upstream is declared in vendor/UPSTREAM.toml and explained
   in vendor/README.md.

2. vendor-pty/  (crate: vitrum-portable-pty)

   A fork of the `portable-pty` crate by Wez Furlong.
   Upstream: https://crates.io/crates/portable-pty
   Copyright (c) 2018 Wez Furlong
   MIT license, full text at: vendor-pty/LICENSE.md
   The single divergence is explained in vendor-pty/README.md.

